 "text": "Steady-state core engine model using lookup tables, 3 inputs, 10 outputs; {Engine Type} sets the type of engine image Compression-ignition, {Load input port name} sets the name TrqCmd, {Breakpoints for load input} sets the breakpoints vector, {Speed input port name} sets the name EngSpd, {Breakpoints for speed input} sets the breakpoints vector, {Temperature input port name} sets the name EngTemp, {Breakpoints for temperature input} sets the breakpoints, {Output Configuration} sets the create output ports, {Power output port name} sets the power, {Power table} sets the power array, {Air output port name} sets the air IntkAirMassFlw, {Air table} sets the air array, {Fuel output port name} sets the fuel FuelMassFlw, {Fuel table} sets the fuel array, {Temperature output port name} sets the temperature, {Temperature table} sets the temperature array, {Efficiency output port name} sets the efficiency, {Efficiency table} sets the efficiency array, {HC output port name} sets the hydrocarbon, {HC table} sets the hydrocarbon array, {CO output port name} sets the carbon dioxide, {CO table} sets the carbon dioxide array, {NOx output port name} sets the nitric oxide NO and nitrogen dioxide NO, {NOx table} sets the nitric oxide NO and nitrogen dioxide NO, {CO2 output port name} sets the carbon dioxide, {CO2 table} sets the carbon dioxide array, {PM output port name} sets the particulate matter and {PM table} sets the particulate matter array. Values come from the instance.",
